Subject: docs: kernel-parameters: Drop the mini2440= entry
Git-commit: c7be8d92b77b7da627b64d5cf7bcd2f40bdf4e72
Patch-mainline: v7.4-rc1
References: git-fixes

mini2440= went away with commit 61b7f8920b17 ("ARM: s3c: remove all
s3c24xx support"); nothing parses it any more.

Drop the entry.

